From b711c9e474cc02cbe54a658ab068915326e46b86 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 21:08:34 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] WIP: adapt to rand 0.10, digest 0.11, p256 0.14, reqwest
 0.13, tokio 1.54 and ctor 1

rand moves random_range to RngExt; digest 0.11 output has no LowerHex; hmac 0.13 keys through KeyInit; p256 0.14
renames to_encoded_point to to_sec1_point. reqwest 0.13 replaces tls_built_in_root_certs and add_root_certificate
with tls_certs_only and tls_certs_merge, and use_rustls_tls with tls_backend_rustls. tokio 1.54 deprecates
AsyncFd::new for the unsafe AsyncFd::register, and ctor 1 requires every constructor to be marked unsafe.
